^{:go/end 821} (go/func ^:go/nosplit raceEnterNewCtx "raceEnterNewCtx creates a new racectx and switches the current\ngoroutine to it. Returns the old racectx.\n\nMust be running on a user goroutine. nosplit to match other race\ninstrumentation.\n" ^uintptr []
